📖 ARCHITECTURE DOCUMENTATION
================================================================================
AgroRescue connects rural smallholders, market vendors, and Women Self-Help
Groups (SHGs) facing perishable produce oversupply with commercial buyers,
food processing units, and local transport operators before spoilage occurs.
