Mathematical Models:
1. Haversine Great-Circle Distance:
   a = sin²(Δlat / 2) + cos(lat1) * cos(lat2) * sin²(Δlon / 2)
   d = 2 * R * atan2(√a, √(1 - a))  where R = 6371.0 km
2. Net Return Economics:
   Gross Revenue = Quantity (kg) * Buyer Offer (₹/kg)
   Total Costs   = Transport Cost + Handling Cost + Platform Fee
   Net Return    = Gross Revenue - Total Costs
   Net Return/kg = Net Return / Quantity (kg)
