🚀 DETAILED SETUP & RUN INSTRUCTIONS
================================================================================
Method A: Run with FastAPI & Uvicorn (Recommended for Swagger UI)
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install fastapi uvicorn pydantic python-multipart
2. Start the server:
   python agrorescue_complete.py
3. Open in browser:
   - Web Application: http://127.0.0.1:8000
   - Interactive Swagger API Docs: http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
   - Health Status: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Method B: Run with Zero Dependencies (Standard Python 3.8+)
1. No pip install required! Simply run:
   python agrorescue_complete.py
   (The script automatically detects if FastAPI is absent and falls back to
    Python's built-in http.server, serving the full web app & all JSON APIs!)
Method C: Run Embedded Automated Test Suite
   python agrorescue_complete.py --test
